// BT-3798 (ADR 0131 Phase 2d): a receiver that is a map but not a Dictionary
// (a value-type instance) and that implements `at:ifAbsent:` itself. A lookup
// whose handler writes an outer local must not run that handler inline against
// it; the guard raises a structured error instead.

Value subclass: Adr0131LookupBag
  field: n = 0

  at: _key ifAbsent: block => block value
